Is it not possible to add a (Lojbanic) *phrase* (not just a cmavo cluster)
on jbovlaste? Often we seem to need a sequence of words that as a whole goes
beyond the existing categories (and isn't listed up on the common
wordlists), for such usual & useful ideas as "this time". Recently xorxes
suggested to me "ca lo ca krefu" for "this time", and I thought it would be
convenient for the beginners if they could find this phrase by simply typing
in "this time" as a query string on jbovlaste.

mu'o mi'e tijlan

